>**{c=red:Notes:}**
* You can only have one Escort for Hire quest active at any time.
* Escort for Hire quests can be deactivated by returning to the NPC that began the quest.
* Only one Escort for Hire quest can be completed each Conquest Tally.
* Can summon trusts.
* Zoning in with an {p:Adventuring Fellow} despawns the Escort NPC.

\**Optional**: Activate the {p:Records of Eminence} 15th Vana'versary III objective __Unwavering Protector (W)__ for sparks and experience.
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Rondipur} to begin this quest.
* Head to {z:Eldieme Necropolis} from {z:Batallia Downs} (I-10).
* As soon as you zone in you will receive a cutscene.
* Once the cutscene is over, an NPC named {n:Cannau} will spawn.
** You will have 30 minutes to complete this quest.
* She will begin to run West towards the door at (H-8). You will either need a {@k} {k:Magicked astrolabe}, or to bring someone with you, to flip the switch to let you through this door.
** Speaking to {n:Cannau} will make her stop running. Talking to her again will make her continue.
** {n:Cannau} will draw aggro from just about everything inside {z:Eldieme Necropolis}. You need to stop her and kill everything in her path.
** If her {p:HP} drops too low she will blood aggro any undead near by.
*** She can be cured, so pay attention to her health.
* After you get past the gate at (H-8), {n:Cannau} will continue to (F-8) taking either the North or South path.
* Once she reaches (F-8) she will stop on her own.
* Quickly speak to her to obtain the {@k} {k:Completion certificate}.
** If she disappears before you talk to her you will not get credit for escorting her.
* Return to {n:Rondipur} for your reward.

